msgstr ""
"Runs in its own terminal on purpose, not in this window: the upgrade "
"replaces the Python and GTK that dynotiq itself runs on. Leave the terminal "
"window open until it finishes, otherwise the upgrade breaks off halfway. "
"Create a Timeshift snapshot first."

#: dynotiq.py:3268
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Ubuntu {v} ist erschienen"
msgstr "Ubuntu {v} has been released"

#: dynotiq.py:3281
#, python-brace-format
